@HospedajeGuanacaste.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5244

### Listar clientes
GET {{HospedajeGuanacaste.API_HostAddress}}/api/Clientes
Accept: application/json

### Reporte de la semana entrante
GET {{HospedajeGuanacaste.API_HostAddress}}/api/Reservaciones/reporte-semana-entrante
Accept: application/json
